GAL22V10
TILEGLZ3

BCLK  BLATCH RLATCH TW  BFIRST TDATA LDATA BDATA NC   NC    NC   GND
HX    Q0     Q1     Q2  Q3     BW    TCLK  LCLK  LATCH NPL  DS   VCC

; PROBE: true-Z T_clk AND keep the NPL macrocell. Needs 11 output macrocells;
; the 22V10 has 10 (pins 14-23) and pin 13 is input-only. Expected to FAIL the
; galette fit: that failure is the evidence for the "external 1G04 on ~PL" trade
; in tile_glue_truez.pld. If this unexpectedly assembles, the trade is void.

Q0.R  = /Q0
Q1.R  = Q1 * /Q0 + /Q1 * Q0
Q2.R  = Q2 * /Q1 + Q2 * /Q0 + /Q2 * Q1 * Q0
Q3.R  = Q3 * /Q2 + Q3 * /Q1 + Q3 * /Q0 + /Q3 * Q2 * Q1 * Q0
Q0.E  = GND
Q1.E  = GND
Q2.E  = GND
Q3.E  = GND

BW.R  = BW + BDATA * Q0 * Q1 * Q2 * Q3

HX    = /TW + /BFIRST
HX.E  = GND

TCLK.T = BCLK
TCLK.E = HX
LCLK.T = BCLK
LCLK.E = TW * BFIRST

LATCH = BLATCH + RLATCH
NPL   = /BLATCH * /RLATCH

DS    = TW * BFIRST * LDATA + /TW * TDATA + /BFIRST * TDATA

AR    = LATCH
SP    = GND

DESCRIPTION
Probe: 11 output macrocells on a 10-macrocell device; expected not to fit.
